{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tenebris is a single player horror puzzle game. Traverse through eerie abandoned subway station while avoiding a mysterious creature to try and escape. Players have to manage your flashlight battery and noise carefully as they navigate a procedurally generated maze. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a silent subway car. The lights flicker, the air is heavy, and the city above has gone quiet. The doors creak open to reveal only darkness \u2014 and the echo of something moving beyond it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but a fading flashlight and a radio that hisses with broken voices, you must navigate the abandoned tunnels below. Somewhere deep within the maze lies the power switch that can bring the train, your only way out, back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re not alone down here.<br>Something\u00a0 hears you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every footstep, every breath, every rustle could be your last. The deeper you go, the louder your fear becomes and the closer it draws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, first person tension-driven survival horror.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated tunnel maze, no two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource-limited survival: manage your flashlight battery and noise carefully.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101400?t=1762458661","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101400?t=1762458661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101400/c207df9f27b7f9105f7782f039f9022f8cc9b0ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762458661","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101400/c207df9f27b7f9105f7782f039f9022f8cc9b0ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762458661","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is a monster hunting you, don't let it catch you"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tenebris is a single player horror puzzle game. Traverse through eerie abandoned subway station while avoiding a mysterious creature to try and escape. Players have to manage your flashlight battery and noise carefully as they navigate a procedurally generated maze. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a silent subway car. The lights flicker, the air is heavy, and the city above has gone quiet. The doors creak open to reveal only darkness \u2014 and the echo of something moving beyond it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but a fading flashlight and a radio that hisses with broken voices, you must navigate the abandoned tunnels below. Somewhere deep within the maze lies the power switch that can bring the train, your only way out, back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re not alone down here.<br>Something\u00a0 hears you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every footstep, every breath, every rustle could be your last. The deeper you go, the louder your fear becomes and the closer it draws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, first person tension-driven survival horror.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated tunnel maze, no two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource-limited survival: manage your flashlight battery and noise carefully.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dream Foundry Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101400/625f3981470cd3913f6e25604d0d1422beb9